- Or Jude < Ivo < Dmitri → Jude < Ivo < 2 → but Ivo < 2 → Ivo = 1 → but seat 1 is Felix → impossible.\\\\n\\\\nSo only possibility: **Dmitri < Ivo < Jude** → 2 < Ivo < Jude\\\\n\\\\nSo Ivo > 2, Jude > Ivo\\\\n\\\\nAlso clue 4: Ivo ≠ 5 → so Ivo ≠ 5\\\\n\\\\nSo Ivo ∈ {3,4}\\\\n\\\\nNow clue 7: Liam is between Dmitri and Ivo.\\\\n\\\\nDmitri = 2, Ivo ∈ {3,4}\\\\n\\\\nSo Liam must be between 2 and Ivo.\\\\n\\\\nSo if Ivo = 3 → Liam must be between 2 and 3 → no seat → impossible.\\\\n\\\\nSo Ivo cannot be 3.\\\\n\\\\nThus Ivo = 4\\\\n\\\\nThen Liam must be between Dmitri (2) and Ivo (4) → so Liam = 3\\\\n\\\\nSo far:\\\\n- 1: Felix\\\\n- 2: Dmitri\\\\n- 3: Liam\\\\n- 4: Ivo\\\\n\\\\nNow clue 1: Liam is to the left of Ivo → 3 < 4 → OK\\\\n\\\\nNow clue 2: Ivo is between Dmitri and Jude → 2 < 4 < Jude → so Jude > 4 → Jude = 5 or 6\\\\n\\\\nNow clue 5: Jun is between Jude and Dmitri.\\\\n\\\\nDmitri = 2, Jude = 5 or 6\\\\n\\\\nSo Jun must be between 2 and Jude.\\\\n\\\\nSo if Jude = 5 → Jun between 2 and 5 → Jun ∈ {3,4}\\\\n\\\\nBut 3 is Liam, 4 is Ivo → so Jun = 3 or 4 → taken → impossible\\\\n\\\\nIf Jude = 6 → Jun between 2 and 6 → Jun ∈ {3,4,5}\\\\n\\\\nBut 3: Liam, 4: Ivo → so Jun = 5\\\\n\\\\nSo Jun = 5\\\\n\\\\nNow seats:\\\\n- 1: Felix\\\\n- 2: Dmitri\\\\n- 3: Liam\\\\n- 4: Ivo\\\\n- 5: Jun\\\\n- 6: Jude\\\\n\\\\nCheck all clues:\\\\n\\\\n1. Liam < Ivo → 3 < 4 → OK  \\\\n2. Ivo between Dmitri and Jude → 2 < 4 < 6 → OK  \\\\n3. Dmitri next to Felix\\\"},\\\"finish_reason\\\":\\\"length\\\",\\\"logprobs\\\":null}],\\\"model\\\":\\\"Qwen/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct\\\",\\\"created\\\":1794483437,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"prompt_tokens\\\":191,\\\"total_tokens\\\":1191,\\\"completion_tokens\\\":1000}}\",\"signature\":{\"text\":\"Qwen/Qwen3-VL-30B-A3B-Instruct:7ee5c4516a46b65769a71e55427ad4bb13fc77f381a08523f54fb979a780881e:d3fe20602c68e844e2185387b586c9b4ee1e76110c6818a09329d43b07c1b42c\",\"signature\":\"0x5b47769cd6b1760f059245a16252211676c4ad14d226cf8f4653f2a41f54bc56157dbade5